cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this analysis, please cite it as below."
title: "PhysioSpace stress decoding of spaceflight tomato (VEG-05 / OSD-767): Light x Condition interaction and cell-type asymmetry"
abstract: >-
  Light x Condition (2x2 factorial) re-analysis of the NASA VEG-05 experiment
  (OSD-767 / GLDS-709), in which dwarf tomato (Solanum lycopersicum cv. 'Red
  Robin') was grown aboard the ISS under red- or blue-rich LED light versus
  ground controls. Includes DESeq2 interaction modelling of leaf and adventitious
  root, GO/KEGG enrichment, cell-type deconvolution (radial root asymmetry), and
  PhysioSpace stress-pattern decoding onto Arabidopsis stress compendia, plus the
  npj Microgravity manuscript, supplementary data and figures.
type: dataset
